# Removed orphan AI session/prompt scaffolding (zero inbound references, not catalogued
# in docs/MANIFEST.md). These globs match ONLY the removed process-scaffolding classes —
# deliberately NOT the MANIFEST-catalogued product provenance kept in this repo: the
# brainstorm transcripts (DOC-BRN-*), the ai-session-audit doc, the gtm-role-prompts pack,
# and docs/planning/session-exports/ (which the GEMINI.md Session Review Protocol requires
# to stay tracked as audit exports). Raw session transcripts are on-demand, never committed.
docs/planning/premortem-transcript-*.md
docs/planning/planning--parallel-*-prompts--*.md
.codex/plans/**/*-prompts.md
.claude/plans/**/*ai-session-audit*.md

# Large binaries
/terraform
*.zip
